# KEEL ai environment example. Copy to .env; never commit real secrets.
# See docs/ENVIRONMENT.md for requirement levels, profiles and source locations.
# Optional assignments stay commented: blank numeric values can break Python parsers.
# Store profile: SERVICE_SECRET only. Insights: DATABASE_URL, APP_DB_PASSWORD, JWT_SECRET.
# Market worker integration is suspended in this review. Standalone team options below are reference only.
# Standalone auth/billing/model knobs below do NOT enable Node integrations by themselves.

# ============================================
# WORKERS AND SCHEDULERS
# ============================================
